   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">TWDtoF &lt;- function (input_la, input_lb){  <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  a =\r\n6370<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  b =\r\n5000<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  e =\r\n(1 - b^2 / a^2)^0.5<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  la\r\n=a +(b*e)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  lb = b+e<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  ans = list(la = la, b = lb)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> \r\nreturn(ans)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">}<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Data1</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">內容如下</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">有三欄位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">a     b    \r\nc <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">10   \r\n20    30<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">5    \r\n10    40<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">20   \r\n30    30  <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">………………………..<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">想利用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">apply </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">函數</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> \r\nTWDtoF(data1$a,data1$b)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">轉換為</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> data2 </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">有五欄位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">a      b   \r\nc   la   lb  <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">10   20  30  ?   ?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">........................</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">不知如何使用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> \r\napply</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">家族函式</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">? <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">感謝各位先進</span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "VWTYE1LnBgAJ",
   "from": "WEPA ^_^",
   "author": "d42e88b7645d03c8",
   "date": "2017-08-18T13:31:05Z",
   "subject": "Re: R 使用  apply 家族函數 ?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Kao,<div><br></div><div>1. 本例應該可以不用apply 即採用方法1直接計算結果.</div><div><br></div><div>2. 方法2使用 <font color=\"#ff0000\">apply </font>函數, 因輸入參數為 a, b 二行, 因此輸入資料是 <font color=\"#ff0000\">data1[,1:2]</font>, 第2個參數是<font color=\"#ff0000\">1</font>, 表示列, 第3個參數是 <font color=\"#ff0000\">function(x)</font> , 因輸入資料第1,2個元素分別表示 a,b, 因此使用指標 <font color=\"#ff0000\">TWDtoF(x[1], x[2])</font>.</div><div><br></div><div>3. apply 結果為 list, 使用 <font color=\"#ff0000\">unlist </font>可轉換為向量(vector), 轉換為向量目的是將資料以<font color=\"#ff0000\">列方式</font>填滿至matrix, 再轉換為data.frame</div><div><br></div><div>4. matrix() 配合 <font color=\"#ff0000\">byrow = TRUE</font> 可將資料以列的方式填滿至矩陣, 否則以行方式填滿資料會異常.</div><div><br></div><div>5. <font color=\"#ff0000\">as.data.frame</font> 可將矩陣轉換為 資料框(data.frame).</div><div><br></div><div>6. 最後用 <font color=\"#ff0000\">cbind</font>函數將原資料與計算結果用欄方式結合.</div><div><br></div><div>7. <font color=\"#ff0000\">identical</font>(data2.a, data2.b) 顯示二種方法結果相同.</div><div><br></div><div>建議採用方法1較佳, 當然方法2亦可做為apply練習用.</div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CipUzHZzJvU/WZbqK1ba1LI/AAAAAAAAL38/AWILsV_-FusGfJYBgahXDD-9-euzcHmRwCLcBGAs/s1600/%25E5%25BB%25BA%25E7%25AB%258B%25E6%2596%25B0%25E6%25AC%2584%25E4%25BD%258Dapply%25E5%2587%25BD%25E6%2595%25B8.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CipUzHZzJvU/WZbqK1ba1LI/AAAAAAAAL38/AWILsV_-FusGfJYBgahXDD-9-euzcHmRwCLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E5%2525BB%2525BA%2525E7%2525AB%25258B%2525E6%252596%2525B0%2525E6%2525AC%252584%2525E4%2525BD%25258Dapply%2525E5%252587%2525BD%2525E6%252595%2525B8.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237599874000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LiUMSnXDuCi8cNnX3xfmV\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CipUzHZzJvU/WZbqK1ba1LI/AAAAAAAAL38/AWILsV_-FusGfJYBgahXDD-9-euzcHmRwCLcBGAs/s400/%25E5%25BB%25BA%25E7%25AB%258B%25E6%2596%25B0%25E6%25AC%2584%25E4%25BD%258Dapply%25E5%2587%25BD%25E6%2595%25B8.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"390\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div># title: 建立新欄位apply函數</div><div># date: 2017.8.18</div><div><br></div><div># 原資料會導致根號內為負數,已調整資料集 a &gt;= b</div><div>data1 &lt;- data.frame(a=c(20,10,30), b=c(10,5,20), c=c(30,40,30))</div><div>data1</div><div>TWDtoF &lt;- function(a = 6370, b = 5000) {</div></font></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div>  e = (1 - b^2 / a^2)^0.5</div><div>  la = a + (b*e)</div><div>  lb = b + e</div></font></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><div>  ans = list(la, lb)</div><div>  return(ans)</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div># 方法1</div><div>data2.a &lt;- data1</div><div>data2.a$la &lt;- data1$a + data1$b*((1-(data1$b)^2/(data1$a)^2)^0.5)</div><div>data2.a$lb &lt;- data1$b + (1-(data1$b)^2/(data1$a)^2)^0.5</div><div>data2.a</div><div><br></div><div># 方法2</div><div>TWDtoF.ans &lt;- unlist(apply(data1[,1:2], 1, function(x) TWDtoF(x[1], x[2])))</div><div>TWDtoFans.df &lt;- as.data.frame(matrix(TWDtoF.ans, byrow = TRUE, ncol=2))</div><div>names(TWDtoFans.df) &lt;- c(&quot;la&quot;, &quot;lb&quot;)</div><div>data2.b &lt;- cbind(data1, TWDtoFans.df)</div><div>data2.b</div><div><br></div><div>identical(data2.a, data2.b)</div><div># end</div></font></div></code></div></div><div><br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kao.u...@gmail.com</a>於 2017年8月18日星期五 UTC+8上午9時30分33秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">TWDtoF &lt;- function (input_la, input_lb){  </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  a =\r\n6370</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  b =\r\n5000</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  e =\r\n(1 - b^2 / a^2)^0.5</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  la\r\n=a +(b*e)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  lb = b+e</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  ans = list(la = la, b = lb)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> \r\nreturn(ans)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">}</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Data1</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">內容如下</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">有三欄位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">a     b    \r\nc </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">10   \r\n20    30</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">5    \r\n10    40</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">20   \r\n30    30  </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">………………………..</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">想利用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">apply </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">函數</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> \r\nTWDtoF(data1$a,data1$b)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">轉換為</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> data2 </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">有五欄位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">a      b   \r\nc   la   lb  </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">10   20  30  ?   ?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">........................</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">不知如何使用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> \r\napply</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">家族函式</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">? </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">感謝各位先進</span></p></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
